# covers: 5 E1.3, 5 E1.7, 5 E1.8, 5 E2.1, 5 E3.7, 5 E3.15, 5 E4.6, 5 E5.3, 5 E5.6, 5 E5.7, 5 E6.6
# fixture: phase5-multisell
# Authored by story 1.8 (expectations) for 3.15 (server assertion sections), 5.7 (UI subscope) and 6.6 (live run).
# Execution evidence is the live gate run (run-sim-ci.py + the schema-2 economy export, story 6.2), never this file alone.
# Expected values: the oracle sidecar <this file>.expect.json (phase5-expectations.py over economy_oracle.py); pack inputs:
# fixtures/phase5-packs.json. RNG-dependent outcomes are asserted on received state; exact draws go through econ-gate labels.
# Waits: delivery 10 ticks*100 ms*3 = 3 s; RPC/login policy 5 s*3 = 15 s; combat fixture allowance 30 s; protection 15 s+5.
# Role blocks (`# role: <name>`) select the pack role whose commands follow; a file without a block is role a.
nf.Login
nf.WaitFor connected 15
nf.EnterWorld
nf.WaitFor in_world 15
nf.WaitFor item_baseline 3
nf.WaitFor exchanger_known 15
nf.Multisell exchanger 616 0 1 enchant:3
nf.WaitFor economy_result == multisell_choose 3
nf.Expect inventory_has 9416 == 1
nf.Expect enchant_of 9416 == 3
nf.Expect inventory_has 9417 == 1
nf.Multisell exchanger 616 0 2
nf.WaitFor rejected == INVALID_QUANTITY 3
nf.Expect economy_result_count multisell_choose == 1
# Total budget: the largest role's sum of declared waits + 30 s exit grace.
nf.Within 84
